#. Tag: title
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "Synopsis"
msgstr "Resumo"

#. Tag: cmdsynopsis
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:52
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kdeinit4</command> <arg choice=\"opt\">--help</arg> <group> <arg>--"
"no-fork</arg> <arg>--no-kded</arg> <arg>--suicide</arg> </group> <group> "
"<arg>+programs</arg> <arg>programs</arg> </group>"
msgstr ""
"<command>kdeinit4</command> <arg choice=\"opt\">--help</arg> <group> <arg>--"
"no-fork</arg> <arg>--no-kded</arg> <arg>--suicide</arg> </group> <group> "
"<arg>+programas</arg> <arg>programas</arg> </group>"

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrición"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"kdeinit4 is a process launcher somewhat similar to the famous <command>init</"
"command> used for booting UNIX. It executes &kde; programs and kdeinit "
"loadable modules (KLMs) starting them more efficiently."
msgstr ""
"kdeinit4 é un lanzador de procesos semellantes ao famoso <command>init</"
"command> do arrinque de UNIX. Executa programas de &kde; e módulos cargábeis "
"por kdeinit (KLM) iniciándoos dun xeito máis eficiente."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Using kdeinit4 to launch &kde; applications makes starting a typical &kde; "
"application a couple times faster and reduces memory consumption by a "
"substantial amount."
msgstr ""
"Usar kdeinit4 para iniciar programas de &kde; fai que o inicio dun programa "
"típico de &kde; sexa o dobre de rápido e reduce significativamente o consumo "
"de memoria."

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"kdeinit4 is linked against all libraries a standard &kde; application needs. "
"With this technique, starting an application becomes much faster because now "
"only the application itself needs to be linked whereas otherwise both the "
"application as well as all the libaries it uses need to be linked."
msgstr ""
"kdeinit4 está ligado con todas a bibliotecas precisas polos programas "
"estándar de &kde;. Con esta técnica o inicio dos programas é moito máis "
"rápido porque só fai falla ligar o programa en si mentres que noutro caso "
"tanto o programa como as bibliotecas que use deberían ligarse."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Disadvantages"
msgstr "Desvantaxes"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The process name of applications started via kdeinit4 is \"kdeinit4\". This "
"problem can be corrected to a degree by changing the application name as "
"shown by <command>ps</command>. However, applications like <command>killall</"
"command> will only see kdeinit4 as the process name. To workaround this, use "
"<command>kdekillall</command> (from kdesdk/scripts) for applications started "
"via kdeinit4."
msgstr ""
"O nome do proceso dos programas iniciados mediante kdeinit4 é «kdeinit4». "
"Este problema pode corrixirse en parte cambiando o nome do programa que se "
"mostra con <command>ps</command>. Porén, programas como <command>killall</"
"command> só han ver o nome do proceso como kdeinit4. Para arranxar isto, use "
"<command>kdekillall</command> (de kdesdk/scripts) para os programas "
"iniciados mediante kdeinit4."

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcións"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "--help"
msgstr "--help"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show help about options"
msgstr "Mostrar axuda acerca das opcións"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "--no-fork"
msgstr "--no-fork"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not fork, i.e. do not exit until all the executed programs ends"
msgstr ""
"Non fai un fork, isto é, non sae ata que acaben todos os programas executados"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "--no-kded"
msgstr "--no-kded"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not start kded"
msgstr "Non iniciar kded"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:132
#, no-c-format
msgid "--suicide"
msgstr "--suicide"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Terminate when no KDE applications are left running"
msgstr "Ter"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "+programs"
msgstr "+programas"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "runs the programs handling requests"
msgstr "executa os programas xestionando os pedidos "

#. Tag: option
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "programs"
msgstr "programas"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "runs the programs without handling requests"
msgstr "executa os programas sen xestionar os pedidos "

#. Tag: title
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:163
#, no-c-format
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "Utilización"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kdeinit4.8.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A standard way to run this program is by simply specifying the following "
"command at the prompt <userinput><command>kdeinit4</command> program</"
"userinput> or <userinput><command>kdeinit4</command> +program </userinput>"
msgstr ""
"Un xeito habitual de executar este programa é mediante a seguinte orde na "
"liña do ordes <userinput><command>kdeinit4</command> programa</userinput> ou "
"<userinput><command>kdeinit4</command> +programa</userinput>"

